# Server-local Compose override, and the Traefik dynamic-config file it mounts.
# Not part of moenet-core: on the control plane these adapt the shared Traefik
# to unrelated services co-hosted on that machine. They are host state — back
# them up with the host, not with this repo.
# See docs/operations/deployment.md: the override changes Traefik's behaviour
# in ways this repo cannot show.
docker-compose.override.yml
traefik-tls.yml
